{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "GXi3KYn65n", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Dan Rather (New York)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 40, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763521, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "xohXYQfLyk", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Iraq / Al-Sadr Revolt / Peace Deal", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) Report introduced. \n (Baghdad: Barry Petersen) The deal brokered by Grand Ayatollah Ali al-Sistani that could end the fighting in Najaf, Iraq, against the forces of radical cleric Muqtada al-Sadr featured; details given of al-Sistani\u2019s demands and of the implications for the Iraqi government; scenes shown of a convoy of Shiites heading to Najaf, some of whom were shot.", "segment_duration": 170, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63040.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763522, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "uYAtE8AJnO", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Russia / Plane Crashes", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) Report introduced. \n (Moscow: Richard Roth) The investigation into the 2 plane crashes in Russia reviewed; details given of evidence pointing to a woman suicide bomber and of Russian President Vladimir Putin\u2019s downplaying of the possibility of terrorism; scenes shown of victims\u2019 relatives, of the wreckage and of lowered flags in the Kremlin. [Carnegie Moscow Center Masha LIPMAN&#134;- comments on the public\u2019s mistrust of the government.]", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63210.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763523, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "YkuiH8yzvR", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Campaign 04 / Bush vs. Kerry / Kerry\u2019s War Record / Economy", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) Report introduced. \n (Minneapolis: Byron Pitts) Senator John Kerry\u2019s efforts to refocus attention away from the Swift Boat Veterans for Truth attacks on his Vietnam war experience featured; details given of Senator John McCain\u2019s call for both sides to quit talking about Vietnam. [KERRY \u2013 says the attacks are standard Republican playbook.] [Kerry supporter Jonathan BERG&#134;, Bush supporter Joe PICCHIOTTI&#134;- offer views on the controversy.] \n (Studio: Dan Rather) Report introduced. \n (Albuquerque, New Mexico: John Roberts) The impact on President Bush\u2019s campaign of the release of the Census Bureau report on Americans living in poverty & without health insurance featured; statistics cited; scenes shown of Bush campaigning in New Mexico with former New York City Mayor Rudolph Giuliani. [GIULIANI \u2013 promotes Bush.] [Southwest Voter Project Jaime CHAVEZ&#134;- outlines critical issues for Hispanic voters.] [BUSH \u2013 campaigns.] [Also in New Mexico, Senator John EDWARDS \u2013 criticizes Bush.]", "segment_duration": 280, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63340.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763524, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "NVHo8rRtvo", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Internet Crime", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) The Justice Department\u2019s conclusion of Operation Web Snare, a crackdown on Internet crime, noted.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63620.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763525, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "jf4kmhq2Mu", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Market Watch: Oil Prices", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) Crude oil prices cited; Stock Market Report.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63640.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763526, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "gsHoGlzR3F", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63660.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763527, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "3gdxFEguDO", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Kia Sorento; Plavix; Minwax; Gas-X; Swiffer; Kia Sorento.)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63680.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763528, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "OBMLNi1LAh", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Inside Story (Marine Van Torching / Fallen Heroes)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) Report introduced. \n (New York: Jim Axelrod) The torching of a van by Hollywood, Florida, father Carlos Arredondo after US Marines informed him that his son, L/Cpl. Alexander Arredondo, was killed in Iraq featured; scenes shown. [Stepmother Melida ARREDONDO&#134;, Hollywood police department Capt. Tony RODE&#134;- describe what happened.] [US Marine Corps Maj. Scott MACK&#134;- says this gentleman was determined to exercise his grief on the only government entity he saw.] [Navy Chaplain Jim LUBEY&#134;- notes the difficulty for bearers of this type of news.] [Former Casualty Notification Officer retired Lt. Col. George GOODSON&#134;- says taking it out on people who bear the message is incomprehensible.] \n (Studio: Dan Rather) Fallen hero Army 1st Lt. Jeff Kaylor&#134; profiled.", "segment_duration": 200, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63830.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763529, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "IvySS74W2w", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Viagra; Lanacane; Prevacid; Serenity; Bush\u2019s Beans; \"CBS Evening News.\")", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 160, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "64030.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763530, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "KyZMNEG7hC", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Flu Season / Vaccine Supply", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) A shortage in the flu vaccine supply reported.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64190.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763531, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "56LO4S5yhR", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Health Watch (Vioxx Warning)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) Report introduced. \n (Washington: Sharyl Attkisson) An FDA study indicating a higher risk of sudden death & heart problems in users of the arthritis drug Vioxx featured; statement from lead scientist Dr. David Graham&#134; quoted; details given of the FDA\u2019s decision not to act. [Cleveland Clinic cardiologist Dr. Deepak BHATT&#134;- cautions against using the drug.] [Merck clinical research vice president Dr. Alise REICIN&#134;- notes studies showing that Vioxx does not increase heart attack risk.]", "segment_duration": 120, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64210.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763532, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "6t1qYrI37q", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "segment_title": "Abortion / Partial-Birth Ruling", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) A New York judge\u2019s ruling on the law banning late-term abortion noted.", "segment_duration": 40, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64330.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763533, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763521, "segment_id": "2J7ENzB2NH", "segment_broadcast_id": "MQaAwCSerB", "seg